1  | P(b) → Q(a)
2  | P(a) ∧ ¬Q(b)
   |----
3  | P(a)                 ∧ Elim: 2
4  | ¬Q(b)                ∧ Elim: 2
5  | | a=b
   | |----
6  | | P(b)               = Elim: 3, 5
7  | | Q(a)               → Elim: 1,6
8  | | Q(b)               = Elim: 7, 5
9  | | ⊥                  ⊥ Intro: 8, 4
10 | ¬(a=b)               ¬ Intro: 5-9
